WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:03.240
- Hick talk, start the clock.

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:04.260
- I need a couple donkeys.

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:05.750
- I could donk all day, boys.

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:06.890
- Call me Rob Donkowski.

00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:07.840
- I'm the Donkey Tonk Man.

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:09.300
SQUIRRELLY: You stick
a penny up your ass

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.490
and it comes out green,
it means you're sick.

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:13.980
- If you're sticking a penny up
your ass, you're already sick.

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:14.820
- Here, here!

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:17.670
GAIL: Need a little
something for everyone.

00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:19.140
- What needs re-caulk?

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:19.940
- Boys.

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:20.970
- Boys.

00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:22.260
- You ready to get
this rig rolling?

00:00:22.260 --> 00:00:23.310
- [DRUMMING SOUNDS]

00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:24.110
That's a drum roll.

00:00:24.110 --> 00:00:24.910
[DRUMMING SOUNDS]

00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:27.360
- Yeah, all right.

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.259
- Over and "oot."

